<table><thead><tr><th>Operation</th><th>Public surface</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Construction</td><td><code>NewForm()</code>, <code>NewTranslatedForm(TranslationFunc)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Configuration</td><td><code>SetTheme</code>, <code>SetCSRFStore</code>, <code>RegisterValidationMethod</code>, <code>RegisterLocalizedValidation</code></td></tr><tr><td>Templates</td><td><code>FuncMap</code>, <code>HasFields</code>; helpers <code>form_render</code>, <code>form_field</code>, <code>form_errors</code>, <code>form_open</code>, <code>form_hidden</code>, <code>form_buttons</code>, <code>form_close</code>, <code>form_honeypot</code>, <code>form_has_fields</code> and the <code>_localized</code> variants</td></tr><tr><td>Rendering from Go</td><td><code>Render</code>, <code>Field</code>, <code>Open</code>, <code>Hidden</code>, <code>Buttons</code>, <code>Close</code>, <code>Honeypot</code>; <code>FieldErrors.Messages</code></td></tr><tr><td>Metadata</td><td><code>Info</code>, <code>RenderModel</code>, <code>WithInfo</code>, <code>WithContextInfo</code>, <code>WithRequestInfo</code>, <code>Overrides</code>, <code>Tags</code>, <code>Overrider</code>, <code>FieldOptions</code></td></tr><tr><td>Mapping</td><td><code>MapForm(r, &amp;input, prefixes...)</code>, <code>MapFormWith(r, &amp;input, options)</code>, <code>MapOptions</code>, <code>InvalidValuesError</code>, <code>MapFormErrorHandler</code>, <code>ParseDateTimeLocal</code>, <code>WallTime</code></td></tr><tr><td>Binding</td><td><code>Bind(r, dst, options, loc)</code>, <code>MapFormLocalized(r, dst, options, loc)</code></td></tr><tr><td>Validation</td><td><code>ValidateForm</code>, <code>ValidateFormLocalized</code>, <code>FieldErrors</code>, <code>FieldValidationError</code> (with <code>Rule</code>); <code>ValidEmail</code>, <code>ValidURL</code>, <code>SingleLine</code>, <code>AcceptsFile</code>, <code>ParseSize</code>, <code>OnStep</code></td></tr><tr><td>Redisplay</td><td><code>Carry</code>, <code>NewCarry</code>, <code>Carry.Encode</code>, <code>DecodeCarry</code>, <code>Carry.FieldErrors</code>, <code>ErrCarryTooLarge</code></td></tr><tr><td>Runtime forms</td><td><code>Schema</code>, <code>Spec</code>, <code>BoundSchema</code>, <code>MapValues</code>, <code>ValidateSchemaLocalized</code></td></tr><tr><td>Selects</td><td><code>SortedSelect</code>, <code>SortedMultiSelect</code>, <code>NewSortedSelect</code>, <code>NewOrderedSelect</code>, <code>NewSortedMultiSelect</code>, <code>NewOrderedMultiSelect</code>, <code>Option</code></td></tr><tr><td>Translations</td><td><code>Texts</code>, the <code>TranslationKey…</code> variables</td></tr><tr><td>Spam</td><td><code>IsSpam</code></td></tr><tr><td>Themes (<code>templates</code>)</td><td><code>RegisterClassTheme</code>, <code>RegisterTheme</code>, <code>Theme.LoadTemplates</code>, <code>Theme.LoadTemplatesFS</code>, <code>ThemeClasses</code>, <code>StyleOption</code></td></tr><tr><td>CSRF</td><td><code>CSRFMiddleware</code>, <code>CSRFMiddlewareWithOptions</code>, <code>CSRFOptions</code>, <code>DefaultCSRFOptions</code>, <code>GetCSRFToken</code>, token injection helpers, <code>DefaultCSRFField</code>; in <code>csrf</code>: <code>Store</code>, <code>TokenConsumer</code>, <code>ExpiringStore</code>, <code>NewDefaultMemoryCSRFStore</code>, <code>NewMemoryCSRFStore</code>, <code>DefaultSessionID</code>, <code>DefaultExpirationTime</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Extension contracts</h2>
<pre><code>type FieldError interface { FieldError() (field, err string) }
type Localizer interface { GetLocale() string }
type TimeLocalizer interface { Localizer; Location() *time.Location }
type Enumerator interface { Enum() []any }
type Overrider interface { FormOverrides() Overrides }</code></pre>
<p><code>ValidationFunc</code> receives a field value and <code>reflect.StructField</code>, returning <code>FieldErrors</code>; <code>LocalizedValidationFunc</code> also receives the localizer. <code>TranslationFunc</code> receives a localizer, key and optional formatting values. <code>Mapper</code>, <code>SortedMapper</code> and key setter interfaces support richer choices.</p>
<h2>Errors and lower-level transformation</h2>
<p><code>MapForm</code> reports invalid destination types with <code>ErrMapFormNotPointer</code> and <code>ErrMapFormNotStruct</code>. Check returned errors and validate mapped data. <code>NewTransformer</code> provides a lower-level field representation when the normal template helpers are insufficient.</p>
<p><a href="https://github.com/donseba/go-form/tree/v2.6.0">Browse the v2.6.0 source and examples</a> for sorted selections, custom themes, the message catalogues and the CSRF store contracts. The README’s Upgrading section lists what changed since v2.5.0.</p>
</article>
